<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-RJ REYNOLDS 6-MTH NET UP 21 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-RJ REYNOLDS 6-MTH NET UP 21 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  61.17   vs	  50.55</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 23.4    vs	  19.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   315.08   vs	 296.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    76.18   vs	  72.89</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	13.0    vs	  11.0</p>
<p>NOTE - RJ Reynolds Bhd is engaged in the manufacture, marketing and sale of tobacco products.</p>
